Place←{
   ⍝ The observer's place ⍵ (latitude, longitude) as captions give it:
   ⍝ VIEW FROM {lat} NORTH, {long} WEST, in degrees and arcminutes
    lat long←⍵
    latd←⌊|lat ⋄ latm←⌊0.5+60×(|lat)-latd
    longd←⌊|long ⋄ longm←⌊0.5+60×(|long)-longd
    hemi←(1+lat<0)⊃'NORTH' 'SOUTH'
    side←(1+long>0)⊃'WEST' 'EAST'
    'VIEW FROM ',(⍕latd),' DEGREES ',(⍕latm),' MINUTES ',hemi,', ',(⍕longd),' DEGREES ',(⍕longm),' MINUTES ',side }
